# Per-run scratch files both test runners write next to the tests. A crashed run
# used to leave one behind as an untracked file in the repository.
#
# The glob is `~*` rather than `~unit_temp*` because of §5.14: a captured temp
# file, `tests/~tmp_test.sz`, was committed in 2026-06 and then twice "restored"
# by people who assumed a cleanup had removed something needed. Nothing under
# `tests/` legitimately starts with `~`, and `tests/parser_snapshot.rs` already
# treats that prefix as "not corpus".
tests/~*.sz
